{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12871","headline":"送卢大理赵侍御祭东岳兼寄孟衮州 · 韩翃","name":"送卢大理赵侍御祭东岳兼寄孟衮州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东岳昔有事，两臣朝望归。\n驿亭开岁酒，斋舍着新衣。\n上客锺大理，主人陶武威。\n仍随御史马，山路满光辉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩翃","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12871.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12871","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}